                {
                  "id": "bs",
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<p>Your satisfaction is our top priority. We deliver projects on schedule and within budget, aiming to leave you more pleased than when we began. We stand by our commitments and uphold the highest standards of integrity. Rely on FSS Solutions for dependable, professional carpentry, cabinet installation, and home repairs throughout Greater Vancouver.</p>"
