    {
      "id": "about",
      "slug": "about",
      "title": "About",
      "description": "Meet FSS Solutions — finishing carpentry built on honesty, integrity and serving others well.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "s10",
          "layout": "1-1",
          "style": {
            "theme": "light",
            "valign": "middle"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "c11",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "b12",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 1,
                  "text": "Who we are"
                },
                {
                  "id": "b13",
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<p>My journey in carpentry started in high school, learning the basics of framing and developing a strong work ethic early on. From there, I spent time living and working on Keats Island, where I gained hands-on experience across all areas of construction. That season taught me to be resourceful, take pride in my work, and do things right the first time.</p><p>Over the years, I found my passion in finishing carpentry—where precision and attention to detail make all the difference. It’s the final stage that brings a space together, and I take pride in delivering clean, high-quality results.</p><p>Today, my wife and I are building this business together with a shared commitment to honesty, integrity, and serving others well. Our goal is simple: to do excellent work, treat people right, and honor God in everything we build.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c14",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "b15",
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "assets/images/about-riley.jpg",
                  "alt": "The FSS Solutions team",
                  "ratio": "3:4",
                  "maxWidth": "400px",
                  "align": "center"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s16",
          "layout": "1-1",
          "style": {
            "theme": "navy",
            "valign": "top"
